	(text "TO COMPLETE: Safety MCU (diverse) with own 8 MHz crystal and own +3V3_SMCU supervisor; FM25V10 copy of key life counters;\nSTWD100 window watchdog on ECU_WDI → gates ECU_RUN_PERMIT relay (G7SA force-guided);\nSMCU_PERMIT_A/B: 1 kHz dynamic outputs → charge pump → G7SA-3A1B coils (stuck pin = permit off); readback of relay contacts;\nXLINK SPI cross-check with H7 (CRC + sequence). Functions: N1/N2 overspeed, TSA/flame-out, purge supervision (03_control_philosophy §8)."
